OL,3,AAuthor and former politician Jeffrey
OL,4,AArcher dies aged 86
OL,5,
OL,6,FBestselling author and former
OL,7,Fpolitician Jeffrey Archer has died at
OL,8,Fthe age of 86.
OL,10,FArcher sold more than 300 million books
OL,11,Fin his five-decade writing career,
OL,12,Fincluding the Clifton Chronicles and
OL,13,FKane and Abel, and has often set the
OL,14,Fnovels in his home town of Wellington,
OL,15,FSomerset.
OL,17,FIn a statement, Archer's publisher
OL,18,FHarperCollins said the author died
OL,19,F"suddenly and peacefully at home" on
OL,20,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
