OL,3,AZelensky condemns 'horrific' Russian
OL,4,Astrike on boat carrying corn in Black
OL,5,ASea
OL,6,
OL,7,FRomania said it had mounted a rescue
OL,8,Fmission after "a fire on the ship Royad
OL,9,FMammadov" outside the country's
OL,10,Fterritorial waters. It said two people
OL,11,Fhad died.
OL,13,FRussia has not commented, but its
OL,14,Fdefence ministry earlier said it had
OL,15,Fstruck two cargo vessels. Russia has
OL,16,Fbeen pounding Ukrainian infrastructure
OL,17,Fin what it says is retaliation for
OL,18,FUkrainian attacks on Russian oil
OL,19,Frefineries and ships in the Black Sea.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
